---
import AppShell from "../components/AppShell.astro";
import "../styles/global.css";
---

<AppShell
  lang="en"
  title="Page not found"
  description="The page you were looking for could not be found." noindex
>
  <section class="subpage not-found">
    <header class="page-intro">
      <h1>Page not found / ページが見つかりません</h1>
      <p>The URL may have changed, or the page may not exist.<br />URLが変わったか、ページが存在しない可能性があります。</p>
      <p class="not-found-actions">
        <a href="/">Home (EN)</a>
        <a href="/ja">ホーム（日本語）</a>
        <a href="/faq">FAQ</a>
        <a href="/ja/faq">よくある質問</a>
      </p>
    </header>
  </section>
</AppShell>

<style>
  .not-found-actions {
    margin-top: 28px;
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 16px 24px;
    justify-content: center;
  }
  .not-found-actions a {
    min-height: 44px;
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    font-weight: 600;
    text-decoration: underline;
    text-underline-offset: 4px;
  }
</style>
